ate over the long term," Mr. Chan said, using the official name for the Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Demand for yuan assets in Hong Kong will likely increase once the value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stabilizes, he said.\par \par \uc2 Write to Fiona Law at \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJTGMS1120150916eb9g0002q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
