rdance with Code A.6.4 of the CG Code, the Board has also established a written \par guideline on terms no less exacting than the Model Code for employees of the Company or \par directors or employees of the Company's subsidiaries or holding company who are likely to \par possess inside information in relation to the Group or securities of the Company. No incident \par of non-compliance was noted by the Company during the period under review. \par  \par PUBLICATION OF INTERIM RESULTS AND INTERIM REPORT \par  \par This interim results announcement is published on HKExnews' website (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.hkexnews.hk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.hkexnews.hk}}}\uc2 \f2 ) \par and the Company's website (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.carrywealth.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.carrywealth.com}}}\uc2 \f2 ). The Interim Report of the Company \par containing all the information required by the Listing Rules will be despatched to the \par shareholders and available on the same websites in due course. \par  \par BOARD OF DIRECTORS \par  \par As at the date of this announcement, the Board of the Company comprises Messrs Li Haifeng \par (Chairman), Lee Sheng Kuang, James (Managing Director) and Tang Chak Lam, Charlie, \par being executive directors; and Messrs Chen Zhongfa, Liu Run, Tong Tang, Joseph and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Yau \par Wing\f28 \uc2 \f2  Yiu, being independent non-executive directors. \par  \par  \par  \par  \par  \par Source: \f28 \uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Exchanges & Clearing\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 August 24, 2015 08:27 ET (12:27 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150824eb8o001f7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
